<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms plan to buy 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms plan to buy 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms on Wednesday sought tenders for 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said they have received tender invitations for the supply of 28,750 tonnes of dark northern spring wheat and 6,250 tonnes of western white wheat for January 1997 delivery.</p>
<p>&quot;All tenders will be opened at 4 p.m. (0800 GMT) on Wednesday,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
